WEBVTT

00:09:59.097 --> 00:10:00.863
that's all that's keeping us alive.

00:10:00.897 --> 00:10:03.297
And it's a very visceral reaction,

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:07.497
this very strong urge to want to protect

00:10:07.530 --> 00:10:09.597
the Spaceship Earth
that we're all you know,

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:11.397
you and I are both crew members here,

00:10:11.430 --> 00:10:14.363
and, you know, we've all got
to work together

00:10:14.397 --> 00:10:16.563
to take care of this ship
that we're moving on

00:10:16.597 --> 00:10:17.730
through the universe.

00:10:17.763 --> 00:10:21.230
So it was a very powerful
response to seeing that.

00:10:22.063 --> 00:10:23.797
PM: Thank you for your work, Megan.

00:10:23.830 --> 00:10:26.397
And what do you say, "Safe flight?"

00:10:26.997 --> 00:10:28.163
Is there ...?

00:10:28.197 --> 00:10:29.363
MMA: We say Godspeed

00:10:29.397 --> 00:10:31.797
or we say ad astra -- to the stars.